{"id":"P042-1","subject":"P","unit":"P042","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P042-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n자기 인덕턴스가 각각 12H , 3H인 두 개의 코일을\n\n직렬로 접속할 때, 상호 인덕턴스가 3H였다.\n\n이 코일의 결합계수 는?\n\n\n① 0           ② 0.25\n\n③ 0.5          ④ 0.75\n\n⑤ 1","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1229}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n자로의 길이가 cm, 철심의 단면적이 cm, 비투자\n\n율이 10000인 철심에 20회의 권선이 감긴 솔레노이드의\n\n인덕턴스는 몇 mH 인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 10          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 40","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1834}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n도체내에서 자속의 변화가 발생하는 경우, 도체내에서는\n\n자속의 변화를 방해하기 위한 전류가 국부적으로 발생하고\n\n이에 따라 역자속이 발생한다. 이를 뜻하는 전류의 용어는?\n\n\n① 역기전력       ② 여자전류\n\n③ 전류역전       ④ 순환전력\n\n⑤ 와전류","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":586},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":615}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n자유공간에서의 파동 임피던스는 377Ω이며, 비투자율이\n\n5인 어떤 매질에서의 파동 임피던스는 188.5Ω이다.\n\n이 매질의 비유전율은 얼마인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 40","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1267}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n귀환회로에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 부귀환회로는 주파수 대역폭이 감소된다.\n\n② 복합귀환회로는 직렬귀환과 병렬귀환이 같이 사용된\n\n  것을 말한다.\n\n③ 귀환신호가 출력전압에 비례할 때, 전압귀환이라 한다.\n\n④ 귀환회로에서 출력측을 직렬로 연결한 것을 직렬궤환\n\n  회로라 한다\n\n⑤ 입력과 동위상이 되도록 출력을 되돌리는 것을 부귀환\n\n  이라 한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n다음과 같은 부귀환 회로에서 전압이득이 –20일 때,\n는 몇 k Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2.2          ② 22\n\n③ 4.4          ④ 44\n\n⑤ 220","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 귀환률이 일 때, 전압이득\n\n은 얼마인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":788},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n3상 유도 전압 조정기의 정격 출력이 6kVA 이다.\n\n2차측 전압이 ± V이고, 직렬권선에 흐르는 전류가\n\n20A 일 때, 조정전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":573},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n다음 조건을 만족하는 유도 전동기의 기계적 출력은 몇\n\nW인가?\n\n  극수2  . 주파수 60Hz, 슬립 0.3, 토크 30N⦁m\n\n\n\n①         ② \n\n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":522},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n최댓값이 200V인 정현파 전압의 주파수가 50Hz이고,\n\n일 때 -100V가 나타나며, 이 순간에 감소하고 있다.\n이 전압의 순싯값V은?\n\n\n① sin°  ② sin°\n\n③ sin° ④ sin°\n\n⑤ sin°","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n정전용량이 각각 2F, 4F, 8F인 콘덴서가 직렬로\n\n연결되어 있다. 이 회로에 인가되는 전체전압이 700V일\n\n때, 8F의 콘덴서에 걸리는 전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 0           ② 100\n\n③ 200         ④ 300\n\n⑤ 400","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1046}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n어떤 선형 회로망의 4단자 정수가 , ,\n\n일 때, 이 회로망의 4단자 정수 는?\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③         ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":480}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n아날로그 데이터를 디지털 신호로 변환하는 PCM 방식의\n\n펄스 코드 변조 순서로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 표본화 → 부호화 → 양자화\n\n② 표본화 → 양자화 → 부호화\n\n③ 양자화 → 부호화 → 표본화\n\n④ 양자화 → 표본화 → 부호화\n\n⑤ 부호화 → 표본화 → 양자화","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":357}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음과 같은 회로에 sinV의 전압을 인\n\n가 할 때, 저항 에서의 평균전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 200         ② 400\n\n③ 500         ④ 600\n\n⑤ 800","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":806},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m14-e2.webp","width":696,"height":445}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n다음 중 유도 전동기에서의 비례추이 적용이 가능한 것은?\n\n\n① 1차 전류, 출력    ② 2차 동손, 출력\n\n③ 2차 전류, 동기와트  ④ 2차 동손, 역률\n\n⑤ 출력, 역률","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":434},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":578}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n환상 철심의 1차와 2차 코일간의 상호 인덕턴스가 1H 이\n\n고, 1차 코일은 s에서 전류가 5A였다. 1초 동안\n전류의 변화를 주어 s일 때 2차 코일의 유도 기전\n\n력의 크기가 7V인 경우에 1차 전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n① 5           ② 7\n\n③ 12          ④ 14\n\n⑤ 19","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":862}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n평행판 콘덴서에 인가된 전압이 200V이다.\n\n이 콘덴서의 전하량을 일정하게 하고, 정전용량을 4배 증가\n\n시키면 콘덴서의 정전 에너지는 몇 배가 되는가?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1251}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n권수가 회, 자기 인덕턴스가 mH인 솔레노이드\n내부 자속이 × 일 때, 솔레노이드에 흐르는\n전류는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":631}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n고유저항이 Ω⦁, 유전율이 2Fm인 액체 유\n전체를 넣은 콘덴서의 정전용량이 177.5F이고, 누설\n\n전류가 4mA 일 때, 인가된 전압은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① ×       ② × \n③ ×       ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":579},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":711}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n저역통과필터의 품질지수가 10, 대역폭이 200Hz일\n때, 중심 주파수는 몇 kHz인가?\n\n\n① 2kHz        ② 4kHz\n\n③ 6kHz        ④ 8kHz\n\n⑤ 10kHz","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1171}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음과 같은 저역통과 필터회로에서 전압이득이 10일 때,\n\n차단주파수는 몇 Hz인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①           ②       \n\n                           \n③           ④       \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":781},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m21-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n                    \n함수           을 라플라스 역변환 한 것은?   \n\n\n①       ② \n③          ④ \n⑤ cossin","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":562},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1239}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n\n저항 80Ω, 인덕턴스                       로 구성된 직렬회로의      mH\n주파수가 50Hz일 때, 회로의 역률은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 60          ② 70\n\n③ 80          ④ 85\n\n⑤ 90","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":595},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":643}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n다음 중 홀(Hall) 효과에 대한 내용으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 일정 온도에서 다수의 도체를 직렬로 접속시켰을 때\n\n  도체 양단의 전위차는 인접한 각 도체간의 전위차의\n\n  대수합과 같다.\n\n② 도체나 반도체 내부에 흐르는 전하의 이동방향에 수직\n\n  한 방향으로 자계를 가하게 되면 금속 내부의 전하\n\n  흐름에 수직한 방향으로 전위차가 형성된다.\n\n③ 다른 두 종류의 금속으로 된 폐회로의 두 접합점의\n\n  온도를 달리하였을 때 열기전력이 발생한다.\n\n④ 다른 두 종류의 금속으로 된 폐회로에 전류를 흘리면\n\n  각 접합점에서 열의 흡수 또는 열의 발생이 일어난다.\n\n⑤ 같은 두 종류의 금속으로 된 폐회로에 전류를 흘리면\n\n  각 접합점에서 열의 흡수 또는 열의 발생이 일어난다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":726},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":460}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P042-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n다음과 같은 전달함수로 표현되는 시스템의 비례감도,\n\n미분시간, 적분시간를 순서대로 나열한 것은?\n\n       \n\n\n\n① 5,    5,   1    ② 5,    5,   0.5\n\n③ 5,   0.5,   0.2    ④ 5,   0.5,  5\n\n⑤ 5,   2.5,   5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.07.14 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h2-e02-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":629},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e02-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1095}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
